28:40.180 --> 28:42.620
If you don't find a solution, you keep going.

28:42.620 --> 28:46.740
But you never know whether if you don't find it is because you don't have enough samples,

28:46.740 --> 28:49.980
or because there is no solution.

28:49.980 --> 28:56.900
But if we are able to find the path to the final destination, it means we don't have a solution.

28:56.900 --> 29:01.300
No, no, it means we don't have a solution up to this discretization.

29:01.300 --> 29:03.180
Because think about this case.

29:03.180 --> 29:13.220
