01:18:31.820 --> 01:18:35.140
will deal with robotic perception.

01:18:35.140 --> 01:18:39.180
In particular, I'll first give an overview of the sensors that

01:18:39.180 --> 01:18:41.580
are available for robots.

01:18:41.580 --> 01:18:45.020
And then we'll focus on cameras, how to model them,

01:18:45.020 --> 01:18:47.660
how to process the data that is collected by camera,

01:18:47.660 --> 01:18:50.420
how to extract features, how to extract semantic meaning,

01:18:50.420 --> 01:18:52.140
and so on and so forth.

01:18:52.140 --> 01:18:56.540
All right, so I'm going to have office hours from now till 1.

01:18:56.540 --> 01:18:59.180
And otherwise, I'll see you on Tuesday.

